y as one of three characters: Gunvolt, the star of Azure Striker GUNVOLT; Ekoro, an angel from Japan's Gal*Gun series; or Beck, the hero of Mighty No. 9. Each character possesses unique skills that will allow players to keep challenging each stage in new and creative ways!\"", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mighty-gunvolt", "videos": [{"id": 13829, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "nwP7NZk7iKI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwP7NZk7iKI", "title": "MIGHTY GUNVOLT (Early adopter Bonus campaign!)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nwP7NZk7iKI/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2731, "name": "Mighty Gunvolt"}]}